---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Intro to Shading">
  <div class="home">
    <h3 class="page-category">Online workshop</h3>
    <h1>Intro to Shading</h1>
    <h2>Thanks for signing up! ✅</h2>
    <p>I'm looking forward to working with you 😊</p>
    <p>I'll send you a link for Zoom a few days before the class starts. In the meantime, please check out the <a href="/shading/supplies/">supply list</a>.</p>
    <p>If you have any questions, please don't hesitate to reach out!</p>
    <button class="button large" onclick="window.location.href='/shading/supplies/'">Supply list</button>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
